  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m Prensi\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\"
    se\xE7tin.\n\n\u015Eu an kendini \"hayalini kurdu\u011Fun hayata kavu\u015Fmu\u015F
    gibi\" g\xF6r\xFCyor musun, bilemem. Ancak e\u011Fer o noktada de\u011Filsen,
    bunun ge\xE7mi\u015Fe dayal\u0131 3 sebebi var {{isim}}. Birincisi, hedeflerin
    do\u011Frultusunda \xE7abalarken gerekli disiplini ve istikrar\u0131 g\xF6stermemi\u015Fsin.
    Bir s\xFCreklilik yakalayamad\u0131\u011F\u0131n i\xE7in de, ini\u015Fli \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015Fl\u0131
    olmu\u015F her \u015Fey... \u0130kincisi, yeterli motivasyona bir t\xFCrl\xFC
    ula\u015Famam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Bazen yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n \u015Feyler
    sana gereksiz gelmi\u015F. H\u0131rsla yol al\u0131rken, bir anda kopup da\u011F\u0131lmalar\u0131n
    olmu\u015F. \xDC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC fakt\xF6r\xFCn ise \"\u015Fanss\u0131zl\u0131klar\"
    oldu\u011Funu belirtiyor kart\u0131n. Hani kimisine \"y\xFCr\xFC ya kulum\" diyen
    o \u015Fans var ya, sana y\xFCz\xFCn\xFC bir noktaya kadar pek g\xF6stermemi\u015F."
